   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "Every test run and everything your client reported are here. The rest is one dashboard per theme, in the bar above: when a lesson's *Watch it* names a panel, it's on the dashboard for that lesson's Part. The bar keeps your client, run and time as you switch.\n\n| Dashboard | Parts |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1 · Basics | Part 0 · Start, Part 1 · Bytes and numbers, Part 2 · The codec |\n| 2 · Blocks and state | Part 3 · Work and reports, Part 4 · Blocks, Part 5 · Hashing and signatures, Part 6 · State and Merklization |\n| 3 · Consensus | Part 7 · Time and shuffling, Part 8 · Safrole, Part 9 · Recent history |\n| 4 · Checks | Part 10 · Disputes, Part 11 · Assurances, Part 12 · Guarantees |\n| 5 · Services | Part 13 · Authorization, Part 14 · Services and preimages |\n| 6 · The PVM | Part 15 · The PVM |\n| 7 · Accumulation and import | Part 16 · Host calls, Part 17 · Accumulation, Part 18 · Statistics, Part 19 · Block import, Part 20 · Facing the fuzzer |\n| 8 · Official vectors | the scoreboard: every official test vector, run whole, from Part 2 on |"
   }
  },
